  "beats": [
    {
      "beat": 1,
      "text": "Elias's paper had his obituary.",
      "start": 0.25,
      "end": 2.21,
      "duration": 1.96
    },
    {
      "beat": 2,
      "text": "It arrived a day early: his name, his apartment, a fire at 3:07.",
      "start": 2.87,
      "end": 7.37,
      "duration": 4.5
    },
    {
      "beat": 3,
      "text": "He was alive.",
      "start": 8.39,
      "end": 8.89,
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "beat": 4,
      "text": "He had no subscription. Underneath, in small print: one name per fire.",
      "start": 10.316,
      "end": 14.956,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "beat": 5,
      "text": "At 2:40, Elias knocked on 4A. Mara's heater had been sparking all week.",
      "start": 15.655,
      "end": 20.675,
      "duration": 5.02
    },
    {
      "beat": 6,
      "text": "She'd asked him to fix it. He told her to call the super.",
      "start": 21.175,
      "end": 23.915,
      "duration": 2.74
    },
    {
      "beat": 7,
      "text": "He took the stairs and didn't look back.",
      "start": 24.595,
      "end": 26.395,
      "duration": 1.8
    },
    {
      "beat": 8,
      "text": "From the hotel, he watched the smoke rise. At 3:07, 4B burned.",
      "start": 26.955,
      "end": 31.875,
      "duration": 4.92
    },
    {
      "beat": 9,
      "text": "The next paper waited at the front desk. Same fire. Same hour. Different name.",
      "start": 32.695,
      "end": 37.855,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "beat": 10,
      "text": "Mara Kwan. Apartment 4A. It said she'd entered 4B to warn him.",
      "start": 39.205,
      "end": 43.785,
      "duration": 4.58
    },
    {
      "beat": 11,
      "text": "Elias laid the two obituaries side by side. His name. Mara's.",
      "start": 44.525,
      "end": 48.945,
      "duration": 4.42
    },
    {
      "beat": 12,
      "text": "The paper wasn't predicting the future.",
      "start": 49.946,
      "end": 51.826,
      "duration": 1.88
    },
    {
      "beat": 13,
      "text": "It was choosing who paid for it.",
      "start": 52.466,
      "end": 54.226,
      "duration": 1.76
    }
  ],
